			id: "69DC68C386D88E9A"
			title: "How to Build a Hero"
			description: ["Aldreth has no classes. You have a people, a handful of stars, and whatever you pick up along the way. A warrior who dabbles in spellcraft is a Spellblade; a ranger who prays is a Hunter-Cleric; nobody will stop you.", "The tree has four Oaths (Might, Finesse, the Arcane, Faith) and fourteen regions. Every star costs experience. Choose a small number of stars well, rather than many badly."]
